Package: ruby-anonymous-loader
Architecture: all
XB-Ruby-Versions: ${ruby:Versions}
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${ruby:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Load Ruby source files inside anonymous namespaces
 AnonymousLoader resolves Ruby files from paths, gem metadata, or $LOAD_PATH
 and evaluates them inside anonymous modules to avoid top-level namespace
 collisions.
